1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,500
Rules run first, on the device. No model, no network, no data.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Before anything could leave, phone numbers, accounts, codes and emails become tags.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:24,500
A normal bank notice goes to Gemini Nano in this browser.

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:31,000
The trail shows exactly what ran, and where.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,500
A clear scam is caught by the rules alone. No AI was needed.

6
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:52,000
With the network switched off, the same check still runs on the device.

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Nothing left this machine.
